import java.util.Scanner;

public class NameInitials {
    // Shortens a three-word name to the initials of the first two words followed by the surname
    public static void main(String[] args) {
        Scanner sc = new Scanner(System.in);
        String name = sc.nextLine().trim();
        int first = name.indexOf(' ');
        int last = name.lastIndexOf(' ');
        String middle = name.substring(first + 1, last);
        String surname = name.substring(last + 1);
        System.out.println(name.charAt(0) + ". " + middle.charAt(0) + ". " + surname);
    }
}
```

**Sample input:** `Anand Kumar Sharma`

**Output:**

```
A. K. Sharma
```

**Another run, input** `Meera Devi Nair`**:**

```
M. D. Nair
```

**Variable description**

| Variable | Data type | Purpose |
|---|---|---|
| name | String | the full name, with the spaces at the ends removed |
| first | int | index of the first space |
| last | int | index of the last space |
| middle | String | the second word of the name |
| surname | String | the third word of the name |
